<title>CANADA: ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS IN WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SUPER-G.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS IN WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SUPER-G.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE LOUISE, Canada 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading official</p>
<p>results in the women's World Cup Super-G Sunday at Lake</p>
<p>Louise, Alberta:</p>
<p>1. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden) 1 minute 22.12 seconds</p>
<p>2. Hilde Gerg (Germany) 1:22.43</p>
<p>3. Warwara Zelenskaja (Russia) 1:22.75.</p>
<p>4. Florence Masnada (France) 1:23.00</p>
<p>5. Katja Seizinger (Germany) 1:23.04</p>
<p>6. Anita Wachter (Austria) 1:23.12</p>
<p>7. Heidi Zurbriggen (Switzerland) 1:23.14</p>
<p>8. Martina Ertl (Germany) 1:23.46</p>
<p>9. Miriam Vogt (Germany) 1:23.64</p>
<p>10. Katharina Gutensohn (Germany) 1:23.83</p>
